{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2022-11-10 07:00:00', 'title': 'ARCHER AND UNITED AIRLINES ANNOUNCE FIRST COMMERCIAL ELECTRIC AIR TAXI ROUTE IN THE US: DOWNTOWN MANHATTAN TO NEWARK LIBERTY INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARCHER AVIATION INC. (NYSE: ACHR) AND UNITED AIRLINES (NASDAQ: UAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR FIRST AIRPORT TO CITY CENTER ROUTE BETWEEN UNITED'S HUB AT NEWARK LIBERTY INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (EWR) AND NEW YORK CITY."}